{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27175","headline":"秋日陪姚郎中登郡中南亭 · 郑巢","name":"秋日陪姚郎中登郡中南亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云水生寒色，高亭发远心。\n鴈来疎角韵，槐落减秋阴。\n隔石尝茶坐，当山抱瑟吟。\n谁知潇洒意，不似有朝簪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑巢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27175.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27175","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}